#
# Kurumi Kernel - userspace profile daemon (Rust, static aarch64)
# overlay.d rc imported by Magisk. Launches the daemon in the BACKGROUND on
# boot_completed. We use exec_background (NOT exec): the daemon runs
# persistently (touch-boost + periodic re-apply), and exec would block the
# init action forever. The daemon writes ONLY profile/runtime tunables to /sys and /proc -> fully
# reversible, no partition writes. CPU/GPU/display thermal mitigation is handled
# in-kernel by the Kurumi performance guard; this daemon does not stop thermal services.
#

on property:sys.boot_completed=1
    chmod 0755 ${MAGISKTMP}/kurumi_battery
    exec_background u:r:magisk:s0 root root -- ${MAGISKTMP}/kurumi_battery
